@startuml session-prompt-assembly-activity
skinparam shadowing false
|ChatClient|
start
:The request: the system prompt from
defaultSystem / .system, the user message;
|SessionMemoryAdvisor|
:Read the active view
(the per-request filter merged over the advisor's);
:Take the latest stored system message, if any;
:System messages first: the stored one, then the request's,
exact duplicates once;
:Prepend the history the request does not carry yet
(from round 2 of a tool loop on, the prompt holds the turn so far);
:Drop a tool call left without its results,
and a result that answers no call;
:Store the request's user message (MessageFilter)
or its tool results (always);
|Model|
:call(prompt);
|SessionMemoryAdvisor|
:Store the reply (MessageFilter; a reply with tool calls always);
:Name the stored event ids on the context;
stop
@enduml
